ess and related disciplines.</p>", "element": null, "lo_domain": [], "number": 2, "sys_created_by": "data.transfer", "sys_created_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "sys_id": "57d1c0fb87b0861042d3ca260cbb35d5", "sys_updated_by": "data.transfer", "sys_updated_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "learning_outcome_element": []}, {"code": "CILO10", "description": "<p>Bachelor of Information Technology graduates are culturally and historically informed, able to work as respectful professionals with Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander communities.</p>", "element": null, "lo_domain": [], "number": 10, "sys_created_by": "data.transfer", "sys_created_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "sys_id": "57d1c0fb87b0861042d3ca260cbb35d8", "sys_updated_by": "data.transfer", "sys_updated_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "learning_outcome_element": []}, {"code": "CILO8", "description": "<p>Critically analyse business decisions in terms of ethical practice and social responsibility.</p>", "element": null, "lo_domain": [], "number": 8, "sys_created_by": "data.transfer", "sys_created_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "sys_id": "5bd1c0fb87b0861042d3ca260cbb35d7", "sys_updated_by": "data.transfer", "sys_updated_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "learning_outcome_element": []}, {"code": "CILO16", "description": "<p>Apply technical and professional skills necessary to operate effectively in business and related professions.</p>", "element": null, "lo_domain": [], "number": 16, "sys_created_by": "data.transfer", "sys_created_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "sys_id": "5bd1c0fb87b0861042d3ca260cbb35da", "sys_updated_by": "data.transfer", "sys_updated_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "learning_outcome_element": []}, {"code": "CILO6", "description": "<p>Use oral communication appropriately to convey information clearly and fluently.</p>", "element": null, "lo_domain": [], "number": 6, "sys_created_by": "data.transfer", "sys_created_on": "2024-03-14 03:00:08", "sys_id": "5fd1c0fb87b0861042d3ca260cbb35d6", "sys_updated_by": "data.transfer", "sys