es a sound education in all aspects of computing and information technology for a career in the profession.</p>\n<p>The international studies component offers an in-depth understanding of diverse cultures through academic learning at UTS and the host institution during study abroad.</p>\n<p>Students choose an IT major and are allocated to a country major as part of the Bachelor of International Studies.</p>\n<p>In the fourth year of the combined degree, International Honours students spend an academic year studying in the local language at a university in the country of their major and also complete an honours level research project under the supervision of a relevant UTS academic.</p>\n<p>Entry to the International Honours pathway is dependent on students maintaining a credit average (or higher) in both their International Studies and professional degree in their first three years of study, and on the availability of placements in particular majors.</p>", "design_feature": [], "duration_ft_max": null, "duration_ft_min": null, "duration_ft_period": {"active": true, "label": "Year(s)", "value": "years", "sys_id": "8313c8814f635b00eeb3eb4f0310c7d8", "type": "choice"}, "duration_ft_std": "5", "duration_pt_max": null, "duration_pt_min": null, "duration_pt_period": null, "duration_pt_std": null, "educational_area": {"active": true, "label": "010070 Information Technology", "value": "010070", "sys_id": "c6142b2fc3ddc2107fe22c4bb0013129", "type": "reference"}, "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "end_date": null, "enrollment_rule": [], "ext_id": null, "ext_reporting_code": [{"applies_to_scheme_1": false, "ext_id": null, "level_1": {"active": true, "label": "Mathematical Sciences not elsewhere classified", "value": "010199", "sys_id": "3b8d0664dbb8a740c7c064a14a9619b8", "level": "3", "long_description": null, "type": "FieldOfEducation"}, "level_2": null, "level_3": null, "order": null, "sys_created_by": "159643", "sys_created_on": "2024-06-27 23:47:33", "sys_id": "3b4ec5fd1b478